                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">&quot;Consummate Professional; Despite being a Christoi Russkoi, Konovnitsyn excelled in working with both Russian and foreign Commanders and neither triggers nor suﬀers Chistoi Russkoi penalties.
Specific Talent; When Personally Commanding a
Formation on an active Withdraw [W] directive, all bonuses become +3.
Flirts with Death; -1 to Leader Fate but +2 if Harmed, 1812.&quot;</characteristic>
